&lt;p&gt;Dear ${host.full_name},&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your visitor has arrived and successfully checked in. Below are the details:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="visitor-details"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visitor Name:&lt;/strong&gt; ${visitor.full_name}&lt;/p&gt;
