&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meeting Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt; ${purpose.name}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;${location.name}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please proceed to the reception area to greet your visitor or notify reception if further assistance is needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="footer"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact reception at [Reception Phone].&lt;/p&gt;
